 "arrive_text": "The road runs a long way through oaks so old that the trunks are wider than a cart, and then opens into a clearing with a ditch and a palisade in the middle of it, and smoke. Outside the ditch, pilgrims are camped in leather tents. Inside it, behind the stakes, rows of iron catch the light: swords and spearheads, every one of them bent double.",
